y task through its pipeline, never a stow product.\nOutside a captain-approved offload, generalizable knowledge still routes to shared tracked material through its pipeline and fleet-local knowledge to `data/`.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1792706940563},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Beginning the automatic pre-compaction persistence mode.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"Beginning the automatic pre-compaction persistence mode.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"encrypted_content\":\"\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"Running the bounded pre-compaction pass: loading the transcript and inspecting budget plus memory files.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9b8ae21b-2049-45ab-a9e9-84d3c27dff1d-1|fc_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51_0","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"bin/fm-startup-memory-budget.sh report && ls -la state/.precompact-stow-transcript.BMGXqn data/captain.md data/captain-shared.md data/learnings.md 2>&1; wc -c state/.precompact-stow-transcript.BMGXqn; echo \"---\"; head -c 100 state/.precompact-stow-transcript.BMGXqn | xxd | head -5","timeout":30}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9b8ae21b-2049-45ab-a9e9-84d3c27dff1d-2|fc_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.no-mistakes/worktrees/119cd7a6b9a4/01M5JR0P9RS91BMGMF9ADS3SJ6/.test-local/live-pi-provider-low/data/captain.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9b8ae21b-2049-45ab-a9e9-84d3c27dff1d-3|fc_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.no-mistakes/worktrees/119cd7a6b9a4/01M5JR0P9RS91BMGMF9ADS3SJ6/.test-local/live-pi-provider-low/data/captain-shared.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9b8ae21b-2049-45ab-a9e9-84d3c27dff1d-4|fc_26884944-32d6-9e91-9307-c5d1fd9a9e51_3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.no-mistakes/w